{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "Slot-table engine (prod)",
  "description": "Architecture walk of the one display engine. UnshippedTable is a feed, not a grid. DataTable is the only paint path. Do not overlay main's DataTable — prod is ahead.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "directory": "src/lib/tables",
      "title": "Engine kernel",
      "description": "Situation: every bindable table in the product is defined here, not under a desk folder. Mechanism: field catalogs, layout cascade, materializeTracks, cohort tripwires, table-engine-law. Implication: a new family adds a catalog + resolver + adapter + registry entry — zero new .tsx. Gotcha: a file under components/unshipped that draws columns is a fork, even if it imports DataTable."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/tables/table-engine-law.ts",
      "line": 92,
      "title": "Five invariants",
      "description": "Situation: TABLE_ENGINE_LAW is data, not a comment. Mechanism: engineIsMonomorphic, registerEntityNotPage, descriptorCarriesDataNotBehavior, verbsBindToFields, readPlaneIsAMount. Implication: To-ship and Shipped are two mounts of tableId orders, not two tables. Gotcha: adding a page-keyed registration (orders-page, shipped-page) is the fork this exists to refuse."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/tables/table-engine-law.ts",
      "line": 364,
      "title": "Acceptance sentence",
      "description": "Situation: the falsifiable claim the cohort greps for. Mechanism: a new backend table adds catalog + resolver + adapter + registry; a verb reaches every mount that binds its field. Implication: if a port requires editing DataTable.tsx, the ENGINE is missing a capability — fix the engine, do not special-case UnshippedTable. Gotcha: 'just this desk' is how Shortage painted every unshipped order for weeks."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/tables/field-catalog/orders.ts",
      "line": 23,
      "title": "Orders catalog is data",
      "description": "Situation: ORDERS_FIELD_CATALOG names facts the /api/orders feed already returns. Mechanism: id + displayType + slotKinds; resolution lives in orders-resolve.ts so this module stays a leaf. Implication: To-ship, Packed, Labels, Shipped share this catalog. Gotcha: orders.scanned_out is stripped off working queues by omitShippedOnlyBindings — a bound dock stamp on To-ship is a layout bug, not a new column file."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/tables/materialize-tracks.ts",
      "line": 4,
      "title": "One place a binding becomes a track",
      "description": "Situation: SlotLayout + FieldCatalog → column tracks. Mechanism: track keys are slot indices (status:1, subtitle:2), never field ids, so rebinding keeps width prefs. Implication: there is no ORDERS_QUEUE_COLUMNS forever-list to cherry-pick from main. Gotcha: identity on the compound morph IS the fulfillment chrome track — renaming it to identity forks Receiving/Tasks/Incoming."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/tables/useSlotTableLayout.ts",
      "line": 4,
      "title": "One client seam for every family",
      "description": "Situation: the layout cascade (savedView ?? staff ?? org ?? product) and the Fields picker data. Mechanism: family specifics arrive as SlotTableLayoutConfig, not a per-family copy of the RMW law. Implication: pickup, receiving, incoming already proved adoption is a config. Gotcha: an admin Save-as-org-default must clear that admin's personal override or the org write looks like a no-op."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/tables/slot-table-cohort.ts",
      "line": 2,
      "title": "Display eval SoT",
      "description": "Situation: the only display eval. Mechanism: engine + every PRODUCT_TABLES peer, not To-ship alone. Implication: after any CompoundItem / materializeTracks / DataTable funnel / header-sort edit, pnpm run eval:cohort slot-table. Gotcha: there is no eval:cohort overlay. Deleting visibility/zIndex styles to silence critique is a cohort fail."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/tables/DataTable.tsx",
      "line": 4,
      "title": "The one display",
      "description": "Situation: DataTable is the only way a table reaches a screen. Mechanism: search + filter as DATA, never JSX chrome slots; compound two-row paint; status bar. Implication: UnshippedSheet already spreads useOrdersSpreadsheet + useToShipChrome onto DataTable. Gotcha: prod DataTable is 1803 lines vs main 1659 — overlaying main here loses prod's slot-table grouping."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/tables/DataTable.tsx",
      "line": 39,
      "title": "Stale search law",
      "description": "Situation: the file still says 'The URL stays the state' for search. Mechanism: To-ship and Shipped find-bars are now session-local useState; typing filters painted rows via filterShippedOrdersByQuery. Implication: simplification step 1 is to rewrite this rule — filters/tabs/sort may stay URL, search must not. Gotcha: leaving this comment teaches the next agent to put ?search= back."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/dashboard/orders-queue/useOrdersSpreadsheet.tsx",
      "line": 197,
      "title": "Orders glue, not a host",
      "description": "Situation: the lean hook one-table-engine-orders-host-PLAN §4.2 asked for. Mechanism: layout → ordersCompoundColumnsFor → useOrdersQueueRows (now over filterShippedOrdersByQuery) → plane + row renderers → props for DataTable. Implication: Pending/Packed/Labels/Staged/Review/Shipped share ONE binding. Gotcha: renderRow is domain, not chrome — do not delete OrdersQueueTableRow to 'simplify'; that is the compound cell path."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/unshipped/UnshippedTable.tsx",
      "line": 58,
      "title": "Feed, not a grid",
      "description": "Situation: 988-line UnshippedTable looks like a table component. Mechanism: query, Ably, rowLimit, fulfillmentLane, lockedFulfillmentState. Implication: the plan forbids turning this into a grid. After UnshippedShelfBoard died, UnshippedSheet at the bottom is the only paint. Gotcha: cherry-picking main's UnshippedTable (1008 lines) would reintroduce URL search and lose prod's feed work."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/unshipped/UnshippedTable.tsx",
      "line": 978,
      "title": "To-ship already mounts DataTable",
      "description": "Situation: UnshippedSheet is the golden call site. Mechanism: chrome = useToShipChrome (local search + filter options); sheet = useOrdersSpreadsheet; <DataTable {...sheet} {...chrome} />. Implication: this is the pattern every remaining OrdersGridHost caller must copy. Gotcha: chrome.search.value is the painted-row filter; do not also pass URL search into unshippedOrdersQuery."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/shipped/DashboardShippedTable.tsx",
      "line": 325,
      "title": "Shipped now mounts DataTable",
      "description": "Situation: OrdersGridHost is gone. Mechanism: useOrdersSpreadsheet + DataTable, same as To-ship UnshippedSheet. Implication: Shipped, Staged, Review packing, Review pairing all spread the same feed. Gotcha: copy-export lives on the spreadsheet return so a lane cannot forget it."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/lib/orders/filter-painted-orders.ts",
      "line": 10,
      "title": "Find-bar is a client filter",
      "description": "Situation: the one matcher for already-painted orders rows. Mechanism: substring over identity/title/sku/tracking/serial; sibling lines of a hit stay so the fold keeps qty. Implication: To-ship and Shipped both go through useOrdersSpreadsheet → this helper. No URL, no refetch. Gotcha: Sets here are dynamic hit-id membership, not a static Record lookup."
    },
    {
      "file": "docs/todo/slot-based-metadata-table-PLAN.md",
      "line": 11,
      "title": "Plan of record",
      "description": "Situation: THIS SHIP is To-ship only. Mechanism: product catalog → org layout → staff → saved view → materializeTracks → DataTable. Implication: do not port pickup/receiving as part of unifying UnshippedTable. Gotcha: one-table-sot-teardown-HANDOFF.md is the display teardown; this plan is the slot kernel. Both still bind. Kill-list 07 is the delete directory."
    },
    {
      "title": "Next",
      "description": "You can now tell a feed from a grid. Execute docs/todo/prod-slot-table-simplify-PLAN.md in the prod lane: (1) correct DataTable's search law, (2) inline+delete OrdersGridHost, (3) do not overlay main's DataTable. Stop when grep OrdersGridHost src/ is zero TSX imports and pnpm run eval:cohort slot-table is green."
    }
  ]
}
